-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 bg-slate-800 text-white hover:text-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-600 active:bg-slate-800 active:text-blue-100 focus-visible:outline-slate-600" color="primary" href="/contact/">Contact Sales</a><div class="-mr-1 lg:hidden"><div data-headlessui-state=""><button aria-label="Toggle Navigation" class="ui-not-focus-visible:outline-none relative z-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center" type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-headlessui-state=""><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 overflow-visible stroke-slate-700" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2"><path class="origin-center transition" d="M0 1H14M0 7H14M0 13H14"></path><path class="origin-center transition scale-90 opacity-0" d="M2 2L12 12M12 2L2 12"></path></svg></button></div><span hidden="" style="position:fixed;top:1px;left:1px;width:1px;height:0;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;border-width:0;display:none"></span></div></div></nav></div></header><!--astro:end--></astro-island>  <div class="w-full bg-slate-900" data-astro-cid-bbe6dxrz> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-20 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:pt-32" data-astro-cid-bbe6dxrz> <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl" data-astro-cid-bbe6dxrz> <div class="flex items-center" data-astro-cid-bbe6dxrz>  <h1 class="font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white sm:text-7xl hero-title" data-astro-cid-bbe6dxrz> Europe Equities </h1> </div> <p class="hero-description mt-6 text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-400" data-astro-cid-bbe6dxrz> OneChronos Markets UK Limited is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority in the United Kingdom (FRN: 1022069) and OneChronos Markets NL B.V. authorised and regulated by the AFM in the Netherlands (Registration Number 14006514) </p>   </div> </div> </div> <main><div class="w-full bg-slate-100"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-12 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="space-y-4"><div><h3 class="font-display text-textHeading pt-4 pb-2 text-2xl">Taking a First Principles Approach</h3><div class="text-base tracking-tight text-slate-600"><p class="pt-4">OneChronos is aiming to fundamentally address several critical market structure issues by introducing modern auction design to financial markets for the first time, taking advantage of advanced technology that has proven to be much more efficient and operates at a fraction of the cost.</p></div></div><div><h3 class="font-display text-textHeading pt-4 pb-2 text-2xl">Quality over speed</h3><div class="text-base tracking-tight text-slate-600"><p class="pt-4">Compete directly on price and quantity by removing speed as a factor in execution quality.   No concept of queue priority in the book.  The innovation in venue design brought by OneChronos, levels the playing field for all investors.</p></div></div><div><h3 class="font-display text-textHeading pt-4 pb-2 text-2xl">Differentiated market model</h3><div class="text-base tracking-tight text-slate-600"><p class="pt-4">OneChronos is bringing Smart Markets, the academic term for markets that match counterparties using mathematical optimization, to finance. Smart Markets have a proven ability to outperform traditional auctions, and the theory underpinning them was the subject of the 2020 Nobel Prize in Economics. </p><p class="pt-4"> Ultimately, OneChronos aims to reduce the cost of execution while unlocking trading opportunities and expanding overall market volumes.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div> <div class="w-full bg-slate-50"> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"> <h3 class="font-display text-ocxPrimary mb-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
Markets
</h3> <h2 class="font-display mb-3 text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-800 sm:text-4xl">
Explore Our Equities Markets
</h2> <p class="mb-10 text-base text-slate-500">
Access transparency data, trading information, and market resources for
        our UK and EU trading venues.
</p> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"> <a href="uk/" class="group hover:border-ocxPrimary relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"> <div class="bg-ocxPrimary absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 rounded-t-xl"></div> <p class="text-ocxPrimary mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
United Kingdom
</p> <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">
UK MTF &mdash; OCXL
</h3> <p class="flex-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
Becoming a Subscriber, Trading Data and Other Documents
</p> <div class="text-ocxPrimary mt-6 flex items-center text-sm font-medium">
Explore more
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="ml-1 h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg> </div> </a> <a href="eu/" class="group hover:border-ocxPrimary relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md"> <div class="bg-ocxPrimary absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 rounded-t-xl"></div> <p class="text-ocxPrimary mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
European Union
</p> <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800">
EU MTF &mdash; OCXE
</h3> <p class="flex-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
Becoming a Subscriber, Trading Data and Other Documents
</p> <div class="text-ocxPrimary mt-6 flex items-center text-sm font-medium">
Explore more
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="ml-1 h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> <a href="trading-calendar/" class="group hover:border-ocxPrimary mt-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-5 shadow-2xs transition-all hover:shadow-xs"> <div> <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Trading Calendar</p> <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-slate-500">
Market hours, settlement holidays, and scheduled trading calendar
            for OCXL and OCXE
</p> </div> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="group-hover:text-ocxPrimary h-5 w-5 text-slate-400 transition-colors"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="w-full bg-white"> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-12 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"> <h1 id="oneSmartMarket" class="font-display text-textHeading pb-2 text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
Front to Back, One Smart Market, End to End
</h1> <h3 class="text-textSecondary pb-10 text-lg">
Together OneChronos and Imandra are eliminating friction, accelerating
        connectivity and redefining execution
</h3> <div class="space-y-4 text-base tracking-tight text-slate-600"> <p>
OneChronos and Imandra are partnering to transform how market
          participants connect to trading venues in the UK and Europe. Building
          on our proven <span class="font-semibold">Smart Market</span> model, OneChronos
          is introducing a streamlined client onboarding experience designed to reduce
          friction, accelerate readiness, and enhance transparency.
</p> <p>
Historically, connecting to new trading venues has been slowed by  <span class="font-semibold">antiquated, manual processes</span> with complex
          documentation, static PDFs, and inefficient testing cycles. Today, OneChronos
          in partnership with Imandra, is leveraging a  <span class="font-semibold">next-generation onboarding framework</span> that delivers speed, efficiency, and clarity with  <span class="font-semibold">Imandra&apos;s Connectivity solution</span>, powered by the Imandra Protocol Language (IPL) at its core. By
          digitising venue rules into a mathematically precise specification,
          Imandra Connectivity uses neurosymbolic AI to eliminate static
          documentation and replace it with a living, dynamic model that can be
          queried and always reflects the venue&apos;s production system.
</p> <blockquote class="text-textTertiary mx-2 border-l-4 pl-6 italic">
&quot;At OneChronos, our mission has always been to remove friction
          and unlock smarter ways for market participants to connect and trade
          more,&quot; said Scott Bradley, CEO OneChronos Markets UK. &quot;By
          partnering with Imandra, we are bringing a new standard of efficiency
          and transparency to the UK and European market. Streamlining
          onboarding means firms can focus on execution, not
          administration.&quot;
</blockquote> <p>This shift delivers several key benefits for clients:</p> <ul class="text-textSecondary mt-4 list-inside list-disc text-base"> <li> <span class="font-semibold">Agility</span> - Faster, simpler onboarding
            with reduced resource demands, "do more with less"
</li> <li> <span class="font-semibold">Transparency</span> - A fully intuitive process
            with real-time progress tracking.
</li> <li> <span class="font-semibold">Efficiency</span> - IPL-generated simulators
            provide instant feedback and measurable certification progress.
</li> <li> <span class="font-semibold">Competitive edge</span> - Time to market is
            significantly shortened, allowing clients to focus on execution rather
            than onboarding administration.
</li> </ul> <blockquote class="text-textTertiary mx-2 border-l-4 pl-6 italic">
&quot;Imandra is excited to see this real-world application of our
          Automated Reasoning technology in partnership with OneChronos. By
          digitising the FIX specification and creating a living,
          machine-reasonable model, we are able to provide measurable benefits
          for trading firms in the region. This is a significant step towards
          bringing a smarter, more efficient standard for market connectivity to
          the financial industry,&quot; said Paul Brennan, Chief Strategy
          Officer at Imandra.
</blockquote> <p>
Already proven in the US, this is the  <span class="font-semibold">first venue deployment of its kind in the UK and Europe</span>. By combining OneChronos&apos;s Smart Market expertise with
          Imandra&apos;s leading-edge Automated Reasoning, the partnership is
          creating a  <span class="font-semibold">smarter, faster, and more transparent standard for market
            connectivity</span>
- reshaping how trading participants engage with venues across the region.
</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="w-full bg-slate-100"> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-12 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"> <h3 class="font-display text-ocxPrimary mb-3 text-sm uppercase">
Contact
</h3> <h1 id="get-in-touch" class="font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-700 sm:text-5xl">
Get in touch
